  "goodToKnow": "Der Geschäftsmann is a businessman; die Geschäftsfrau a businesswoman. The plural is usually die Geschäftsleute, as with Kaufmann and Kaufleute, though Geschäftsmänner is also heard. Geschäftlich unterwegs sein means to be away on business. A more modern word is der Unternehmer (entrepreneur). The traditional ideal of der ehrbare Kaufmann (the honourable merchant) dates back to the Hanseatic League."
